<h3><span class="name western">Amir Abdollahi</span></h3>
<div class="p">
<sup>2</sup>Division of Molecular and Translational Radiation Oncology, National Center for Tumor Diseases (NCT), Heidelberg University Hospital, 69120 Heidelberg, Germany; s.mein@dkfz-heidelberg.de (S.M.); a.amir@dkfz-heidelberg.de (A.A.); i.dokic@dkfz-heidelberg.de (I.D.)</div>
